  "notes": [
    "The ratio-check exception is Clearing code from deployment, but every exploit deposit ran about 12% off TWAP and passed only because the vault's priceThreshold was 200 (100 reverts). The tx that added the vault to Clearing with that threshold is the later change and sets the age (rule 8).",
    "One attacker hit four vaults behind three sibling Clearing v1.2.3 deployments (Camelot, Ramses, Uniswap) within minutes, so this is one incident (rule 4); the Ramses and gDAI-DAI records merge here. Copycats 0xccc599f3 and 0x0381d997 repeated it within the hour and are in the campaign.",
    "Victims are the four vaults and their pools, netted per asset over the campaign. wstETH has no Arbitrum price history and is valued at DefiLlama's Ethereum wstETH price at exploit time."
